{"4371830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Run & Dungeon", "steam_appid": 4371830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run &amp; Dungeon - A Dungeon Crawler Incremental Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining aspects of incremental games, roguelikes, and dungeon crawlers, Run &amp; Dungeon offers a unique incremental game experience where your party of intrepid heros delves through dungeon after dungeon, clearing room after room of ancient debris, mysterious fauna, and more, all to pursue a mysterious power that lies just outside your reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371830/extras/0c95ce87873f6ac5b93f3504cffdedac.avif?t=1781529458\" width=588 height=764 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore many unique and specially designed environments, such as a long abanoned dungeon with a cryptic ghostly warden, a mysterious forest where eyes seem to follow your every move, and more. As you discover each new location, your powers as adventurers grow, and you learn more and more about the power you seek, and the obstacles in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371830/extras/7a82972deef262299c9bdc47a914f737.poster.avif?t=1781529458\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371830/extras/7a82972deef262299c9bdc47a914f737.webm?t=1781529458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371830/extras/7a82972deef262299c9bdc47a914f737.mp4?t=1781529458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expansive Skill Tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like many incremental games, explore a deep and complex, yet fully unlockable skill tree to boost your party's powers as you explore. Discover unique synergies between abilities, and race farther and farther to the end of each dungeon with each upgrade purchased.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run &amp; Dungeon - A Dungeon Crawler Incremental Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining aspects of incremental games, roguelikes, and dungeon crawlers, Run &amp; Dungeon offers a unique incremental game experience where your party of intrepid heros delves through dungeon after dungeon, clearing room after room of ancient debris, mysterious fauna, and more, all to pursue a mysterious power that lies just outside your reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371830/extras/0c95ce87873f6ac5b93f3504cffdedac.avif?t=1781529458\" width=588 height=764 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore many unique and specially designed environments, such as a long abanoned dungeon with a cryptic ghostly warden, a mysterious forest where eyes seem to follow your every move, and more. As you discover each new location, your powers as adventurers grow, and you learn more and more about the power you seek, and the obstacles in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371830/extras/7a82972deef262299c9bdc47a914f737.poster.avif?t=1781529458\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371830/extras/7a82972deef262299c9bdc47a914f737.webm?t=1781529458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371830/extras/7a82972deef262299c9bdc47a914f737.mp4?t=1781529458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expansive Skill Tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like many incremental games, explore a deep and complex, yet fully unlockable skill tree to boost your party's powers as you explore. Discover unique synergies between abilities, and race farther and farther to the end of each dungeon with each upgrade purchased.</p>", "short_description": "Run &amp; Dungeon is a fast paced incremental game where your party of fearless adventurers speed through dungeons in search of legendary loot. Smash through anything blocking your path to earn resources, unlock upgrades, learn powerful new abilities, and expand your team. Delve deep into the unknown...", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371830/eed5c40fecf4d2ff57b3252a91386d26a7ecbb5f/header.jpg?t=1781529458", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371830/92bd5db3cc1310faed3a883d90c3749a836a56d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781529458", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371830/92bd5db3cc1310faed3a883d90c3749a836a56d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781529458", "website": "https://ratshackgames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Rat Shack Games"], "publishers": ["Rat Shack